  "version": "1",
  "text": "This ensemble balances refined texture with understated elegance for your New Year celebration. The graphite skirt anchors the look with its clean, straight line and functional button details, while the grey pinstripe blazer adds a touch of classic tailoring. Over it, the warm terracotta coat wraps you against the frosty autumn air, introducing rich earth tones that complement your palette. Finally, the burgundy slouch boots in soft suede provide height without sacrificing comfort, and the chocolate two-sided scarf offers a gentle pop of color at the neckline. The ginger leather tote grounds the outfit with its sturdy structure, completing a look that feels both celebratory and effortlessly polished.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Drape the chocolate scarf loosely around your neck to keep the focus on the coat's collar while adding a soft contrast to the graphite skirt."
  ],
